    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Comodo Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Comodo Guide]\nThe villagers of ^8B4513Comodo^000000\nhave overcome their poor natural surroundings\nto create a popular tourist site.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?",
      "translation" : "[克魔島嚮導]\n^8B4513克魔島^000000的居民克服了惡劣的自然環境，把這裡建成了熱門旅遊勝地。\n還有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？"
